WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.810
I know what I want it to be.

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.884
I know what I want to do. I know who I want to help.

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.478
I know how I want people to feel.

4
00:00:59.050 --> 00:00:59.977
You okay?

5
00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.785
Does it look like I'm okay?

6
00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:03.064
Fair enough.

7
00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.340
Where am I?

8
00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:06.206
A place to hear yourself think.

9
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:07.770
That doesn't answer me.

10
00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:08.690
It will.

11
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.103
Come on.

12
00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.394
I don't even know where to start.

13
00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.666
Then don't start with everything.

14
00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.931
What does that even mean?

15
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.587
What were you trying to build?

16
00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.033
Show me.

17
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:25.455
Show you what?

18
00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:26.887
Everything.

19
00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:29.347
It's a mess.

20
00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.431
It doesn't have to be finished.

21
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.885
I know who I want to help. But making it real?

22
00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.164
That's where I get lost.

23
00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.670
The logo. The website. The content.

24
00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.287
Every answer brings more questions.

25
00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.308
Show me what you have.

26
00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.181
That's what I keep looking at.

27
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.271
Nothing feels like me.

28
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.300
Maybe I'm just not good at this.

29
00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:02.491
At what?

30
00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.143
This.

31
00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:07.105
Making it look like what I see in my head.

32
00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.199
That's not it.

33
00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:10.923
You know what you want to say.

34
00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.152
Then why can't I make it look right?

35
00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.615
Because you're building before you've finished listening.

36
00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.923
You're trying to solve every piece separately.

37
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.997
But they're connected.

38
00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.587
Your website.

39
00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.373
Your logo.

40
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.880
Your content.

41
00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.923
It's all one story.

42
00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.167
Wait right there.

43
00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.840
I have something for you.

44
00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.071
How did you know?

45
00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.299
You already knew.

46
00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.273
I just built it.

47
00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.313
What is that?

48
00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.650
It's your story.

49
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.760
Come on. It's time to head home.

50
00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.759
Is this all in my head?

51
00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.597
Every world begins there.

52
00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:03.852
I don't know where to start.

53
00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.155
That's okay.

54
00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.880
We'll start together.

55
00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.869
Bring the idea.

56
00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.431
We'll help you build it.
